    "locked": false,
    "maintainer_can_modify": false,
    "title": "interfaces: fix findAncestorByHash returning true for unknown descendant",
    "user": {
      "login": "Romansage6",
      "id": 182553131,
      "node_id": "U_kgDOCuGKKw",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/182553131?v=4",
      "gravatar_id": "",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Romansage6",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/Romansage6",
      "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Romansage6/followers",
      "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Romansage6/following%7B/other_user%7D",
      "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Romansage6/gists%7B/gist_id%7D",
      "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Romansage6/starred%7B/owner%7D%7B/repo%7D",
      "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Romansage6/subscriptions",
      "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Romansage6/orgs",
      "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Romansage6/repos",
      "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Romansage6/events%7B/privacy%7D",
      "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Romansage6/received_events",
      "type": "User",
      "site_admin": false,
      "name": null,
      "patch_url": null
    },
    "body": "findAncestorByHash nulled out 'ancestor' only when the descendant block was\nalso known, due to a 'block &&' guard. If block_hash didn't resolve to a\nknown block, the guard short-circuited and the still-valid ancestor pointer\nwas passed to FillBlock, causing the call to report success for an unknown\ndescendant.\n\nchecked the sibling functions findCommonAncestor and findAncestorByHeight\nfor the same short-circuit pattern; both already default to a null result\nwhenever either lookup fails, so no equivalent bug exists there.\n\nExtended the existing interfaces_tests/findAncestorByHash unit test with a\nregression assertion for an unknown descendant hash. Verified it fails\nwithout the fix and passes with it\n(./build/bin/test_bitcoin --run_test=interfaces_tests/findAncestorByHash).\n\nfixes #36472\n",
    "labels": [
      {
