      "message": "interfaces: fix findAncestorByHash returning true for unknown descendant\n\nfindAncestorByHash nulled out 'ancestor' only when the descendant block was\nalso known, due to a 'block &&' guard. If block_hash didn't resolve to a\nknown block, the guard short-circuited and the still-valid ancestor pointer\nwas passed to FillBlock, causing the call to report success for an unknown\ndescendant.\n\nAdd a regression assertion to the existing findAncestorByHash unit test.\n\nfixes #36472",
